    <http://example.org/node/chunk82> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "The project must be conducted progressively with a pilot phase on one office or mission line, followed by progressive generalisation." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message3> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk83> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "Given our PM methodologies, past public sector references, consortium partners, available capacity, and governance practices as of 2024, how can our structure The project to meet these requirements and ensure a smooth deployment?" ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message3> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk84> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "Based on our company context, our can propose a structured approach to meet the client's requirements. our hybrid delivery model combining agile iterations with a phase-gate structure is well-suited for The project. our will start with the Framing phase, where our pay particular attention to confidentiality, existing production tools, and seasonality of workload, which are crucial for professional-services clients." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message3> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk85> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "Given our past references in the public sector, such as the regional council and mutual health insurer projects, our can leverage our experience in delivering solutions that ensure confidentiality, reliability, and explainability. our consortium partner, Ligeo Conseil, can support the integration with the client's production tools, ensuring a high-quality connection." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message3> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk86> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "To conduct The project progressively, our will start with a pilot phase on one office or mission line, as required by the client." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message3> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk87> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "This approach allows our to test and refine our solution before proceeding to progressive generalisation. our available capacity, including a dedicated team with a project director, solution architect, engineers, data scientist, and security compliance lead, can support This approach." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message3> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk88> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "In terms of governance, our will establish a joint steering committee with the client, meeting monthly, and an operational committee, meeting fortnightly. our will also define roles in a RACI matrix and have a single accountable project director as the point of contact. our documented escalation path ensures that any issues are addressed promptly." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message3> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk89> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "By following Our hybrid delivery model combining agile iterations with a phase-gate structure, leveraging our past experiences, and engaging our consortium partners, our can ensure a smooth deployment that meets the client's requirements for productivity, quality, reliability, and professional secrecy. our will also ensure that our solution is explainable, reliable, and preserves the confidentiality of client data, while being mindful of the seasonality of workload and existing production tools." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message3> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk9> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "Quick access to reliable, up-to-date information drawn from accounting standards (PCG), tax doctrine and the tax code (CGI), the commercial code and applicable legal texts, collective-bargaining agreements for payroll/social, and Cabinet Vauclair & Associés internal procedures and methodology guides." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message0> .

